// End state text pools — defeat messages and per-condition mission brief / victory / timeout text

title: defeat_descriptions
---
Your last system has fallen. The stars no longer answer to you.
The enemy consumed everything. Silence where your fleets once roared.
Overrun. Your empire exists only in memory.
The void swallowed you whole. Nothing remains but dust.
Every system lost. Every fleet gone. The galaxy moves on without you.
===

// Condition: total_annihilation
title: total_annihilation_brief
---
Eliminate all enemy fleets and capture every system.
===

title: total_annihilation_end
---
Total conquest. Every system bends to your will.
===

// Condition: fleet_elimination
title: fleet_elimination_brief
---
Eliminate all enemy fleets.
===

title: fleet_elimination_end
---
The void is silent. No fleet dares challenge you.
===

// Condition: capture_target_system
title: capture_target_system_brief
---
Capture the marked system deep in enemy territory.
===

title: capture_target_system_end
---
The distant system falls under your command.
===

// Condition: eliminate_faction
title: eliminate_faction_brief
---
Eliminate the marked faction before time runs out.
===

title: eliminate_faction_end
---
The marked faction is destroyed. The stars are yours.
===

title: eliminate_faction_timeout
---
Enemy reinforcements arrived. The window has closed.
===

// Condition: defend_and_eliminate
title: defend_and_eliminate_brief
---
Defend the marked system and eliminate all enemies.
===

title: defend_and_eliminate_end
---
All enemies destroyed. The marked system stands.
===

title: defend_and_eliminate_timeout
---
The enemy has entrenched. You failed to hold the line.
===
